WEBVTT

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.960
Hey!

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.610
Why'd you ask us to come out here?

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.840
We spotted her on our way
home from shopping...

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.350
She looks kinda unsteady.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.970
Maybe she's just really busy
getting ready for New Year's?

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.640
That's not all it is.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:50.190
Oh, it's this way. I'll show you.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.550
That's the fifth time.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:05.150
Oh, you're all here?

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.330
What's going on?

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.380
Don't you think you're spending
too much time on ghosts?

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:14.560
What did you do yesterday?

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.050
Um...

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.930
I got ready for New Year's...

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:26.250
I lost my triangle hat!

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.690
Helped someone find something they lost...

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.810
I'm about to go on a date!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:36.350
And in the evening, I helped with some sewing...

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.270
Are you stupid or what?!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.970
No wonder you can barely stay upright!

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.540
You need to take better care of yourself!

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.080
O-Okay...

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.370
Inoue, you're pretty strict.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.840
Let's play!

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:04.970
What did I <i>just</i> say?!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.980
Talking to Amami's dad <i>is</i> a good idea,

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.520
but are you sure about this, Inoue?

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.220
What choice do we have?

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.250
You can tell her what you want,
she just can't say no to a ghost.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.670
I'm sorry...

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:55.110
That's not what I meant.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.800
We're going to Amami's house, you know.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.840
This is gonna be awesome.

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:01.630
Yeah, maybe it's like...

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.430
No way!

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.350
What haunted hotel is that?!

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:13.810
So this is it!

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.860
It's no haunted hotel, but...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.240
Clearly it's very scary...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:26.330
Or maybe not.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.750
Yeah.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.460
I see. That bad, huh?

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:34.210
I've been a bit worried myself.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.580
Isn't there anything you can do?

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:41.990
There may be something...

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:42.890
Oh!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.160
I'll go look. Sit tight, okay?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.070
That's not the voice of anyone in this family!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.630
Dad, are you all right?!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.790
Sixth-sense sealing specs!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.290
These glasses can suppress the sixth sense?

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.820
Yes.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:22.090
My wife used to use them once in a while.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.440
Really?

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:24.590
Wow.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.600
When did she use them?

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:32.310
Well, like when a cute little ghost puppy
put its chin in her lap to beg during meals.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.690
I could never eat if I saw that!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.690
Okay, let's try them.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.700
Now, keep them on for three days.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.700
Th-Three days?!

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:55.330
Take a break from being the
sixth-sense girl once in a while!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.960
I'm sure the ghosts
won't be mad at you for that.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:02.210
Though the loneliness might be a second death to some...

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.530
You need a break.

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:07.510
At this rate, you might end up
joining them before long.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:08.930
But...

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.750
If you take those glasses off,
we're not friends anymore!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.320
<i>Is she a little kid?!</i>

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.360
I-I promise I won't!

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.940
<i>It worked?!</i>

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:29.670
Yo, Hibby!

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.330
Wanna hang out?

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:33.390
Hey, you got glasses!

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.620
Are they fake? They're not even that cool.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:41.210
Huh? Are you mad at me?

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:46.430
Oh, is it because I ate the offering
you left for the samurai dude?

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.710
My bad!

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:50.680
I shouldn't have gotten carried
away and eaten all of it.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:51.560
Well now...

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:55.740
You've dug your own grave!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.750
What?

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.320
Those glasses stop her from seeing us?

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:04.580
They are meant to help Lady Amami rest.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.300
She can't even hear us?

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.640
Not one word.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.320
Lame.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.940
Oh, hey, if she can't hear you anyway,

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:16.970
how 'bout telling her how you feel about her?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.340
Wh-What nonsense do you speak of?!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:24.060
You've got the hots for her, right?
It's totally obvious.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:24.590
I...

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.600
I would never entertain such thoughts.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.000
This is your chance to practice.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.600
Silence, you rapscallion!

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:37.720
So long as I am able to guard Lady Amami,
to whom I am so indebted,

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:38.810
I am content.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.640
That's really enough?

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.060
Yes.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:43.770
Amami!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.570
You got glasses?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.730
They make you look different!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.740
We're going to karaoke. Wanna come with us?

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:53.990
You're sure?

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.420
A-Absholuthly!

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.000
You're totally losing it.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:02.500
Today's sale was delicious taiyaki!

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.550
Uh, I'm over here.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:11.720
I'm sorry I'm fumbling around
blindly today. It's complicated.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.810
That's my nose!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:27.320
I'm sorry. I have to keep my
sixth sense suppressed for now.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.820
I can't talk to you today,

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.010
but please call me over again some other time.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.890
Yeah... Later.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.640
Sorry, lady.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.930
Oh, dear.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.750
I'm sorry if my grandson bothered you.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:03.640
It's all right.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.360
Hey, come play with me, lady!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.980
C'mon, c'mon!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.950
Let's play! C'mon!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.590
Ready? Here I go!

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:17.910
I'm ready!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.620
I'm sorry.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.200
Wait, ball!

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:28.320
Here it comes.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.220
There.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.260
Looks like she's having fun.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:37.750
Maybe she'll actually be happier this way.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.350
H-Huh?

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.500
Mana, where are you?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.730
Mana!

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.290
What's wrong?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.270
I can't find his little sister.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:54.450
She was right here just a moment ago.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.390
Mana!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.450
Mana!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.370
Mana!

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:07.250
What will I do?

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.540
<i>It's getting dark.</i>

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.260
<i>And there'll be lots of traffic at this hour...</i>

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:20.260
<i>We don't have enough people. W-We need help...</i>

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.350
If you take those glasses off,
we're not friends anymore!

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:50.240
Oh, yeah, that's the ringtone I set for Amami.

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:51.430
Hello?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.500
I'm sorry.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.920
Wh-What is it?

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:57.750
Um...

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:02.060
Um, the glasses...

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:08.210
Y-You said we wouldn't be friends...
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.330
I can't do it alone!

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:16.320
You really can be an idiot...

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:20.070
You called because it's an emergency, right?

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.310
I'll still be your friend.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.660
Take them off already.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.060
Okay!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.840
Is anyone nearby?!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.060
Present.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.930
What's with the blatantly flashy entrance?

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.480
S-Silence, you rapthcallion!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:51.340
Um...

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:55.060
Please! I need your help!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.950
He's so obvious.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.060
Search every nook and cranny!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.990
Start low to the ground.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.460
Roger!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.700
Where are you?

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.560
It's so dark in the shadows!

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.960
Hey, I hear a voice!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.010
Over there?

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.150
That's close!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.400
Mana!

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:29.200
H-Hello?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.400
I've found her.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.440
Really?!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.700
Thank you so much.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:42.780
Thank goodness.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.220
We were so worried.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:48.790
Starting low to the ground was a good idea.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:53.660
Wait, I feel like I know that
voice from somewhere...

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.840
Yes?

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.840
Inoue?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.040
We found her.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.600
Oh, thank goodness—

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:16.600
N-Not that I was worried or anything.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.540
Yahoo! First shrine visit of the year!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.430
You're so hyper, Yamada.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.290
Of course I am!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:38.730
I'm the only guy in the group!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.090
I've got a harem!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.170
Woohoo!

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:41.940
No matter how you look at it,
he's just our pack mule.

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:44.680
Banzai! Harem!

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.950
Banzai! Banzai! Harem!
If we get separated, meet back at Yamada.

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.130
He stands out so much, he'll be easy to find.
Banzai! Banzai! Harem!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:49.510
Banzai! Banzai! Harem!

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:59.060
Inoue, you look so pretty
when you're dressed up.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.140
F-Flattery won't get you anywhere.

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:03.030
Pardon?

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.030
You look pretty nice yourself, Amami.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:15.260
You have surprisingly good fashion sense.

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.580
Thank you!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.160
I like this one!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.970
Seriously?

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:22.880
This one's better.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.880
Yay!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.340
It was ten to three!

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:31.980
Uh-huh...

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:36.370
It sure is crowded.

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:39.590
Stick together, everyone.

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:40.190
Right!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.150
She meant you.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:46.690
It's all right. I'll be sure to stay close.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:54.830
<i>As expected...</i>

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:00.750
Time to make our offerings.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:04.480
Fifteen yen, for family and friends.

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:06.680
That's an old gag.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:08.390
Ready, and...

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:12.870
Yay!

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:15.720
For sixty times the friendships!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.810
Don't throw it all in at once!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:20.510
What did you pray for, Amami?

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.770
I made lots of wishes.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.320
My wish is simple.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.720
What was it?

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:33.080
Obliteration!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.240
Those are all from my brother!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:39.750
Good luck...

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.800
What'd you all get?

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.290
Good luck.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.710
Woohoo! Very good luck!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.010
Future good luck.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.630
Slight luck.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.540
Ugh...

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.370
Bad luck.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.810
Hello, it's Uehara.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.050
I am Mary.

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:04.130
I'm peeking at your fortune right now.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.040
Have a great year.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.670
Oh, dear, bad luck...

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.090
Snacks like these are so exciting somehow.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:18.550
We don't get the chance to eat them every day.

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:21.080
Yeah, only at places like this.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.380
I'm back!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:34.780
C'mon, Amami! That's dangerous, y'know!

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:37.000
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.600
Well, it's a holiday.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.400
I'll let it slide.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.130
Just... this... once.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.120
She's been drinking amazake.

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.950
They're giving it away for free over there.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.410
I don't think she knew what she was drinking.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.570
Know what your problem is?

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:00.780
You're too scary, talkin' about ghosts all the time.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:03.270
Do you even notice how much it freaks me out?!

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.580
You could try to understand a little, y'know?

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:11.040
Weird and wondrous: the moment of possession!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:13.510
Don't record this!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:16.180
Wh-What should we do?

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:18.270
We'll just have to...

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:21.100
ask all kinds of embarrassing
questions while her lips are loose!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.330
I agree.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.340
W-We shouldn't!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.520
Women...

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.230
Aren't you curious?

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.560
No!

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.780
What about her crushes?

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.690
W-We mustn't!

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:37.070
What color panties are you wearing today?

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.370
Darn it! They're white, okay?!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.370
White.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:46.500
First sexual harassment of the year, complete!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:51.090
So, Inoue, who do you love?

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:52.590
Nana.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.060
Not like that.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:56.800
Like, who would you want for
your cell phone wallpaper?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.640
You know, as a woman.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.060
Nana!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.350
She's unyielding!

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.570
Who was your first love?!

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:05.910
Nana.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:08.030
Who's your role model?

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:09.130
Nana!

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:11.840
If you could be anyone for a day,
who would it be?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.410
Nana!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.430
Your granddaughter is bonkers!

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:18.610
They criticized her guardian angel!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.250
Don't you want to ask her
something, Amami?

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.400
Oh, no...

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.860
It's a good opportunity. You should ask!

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:29.160
I... I couldn't...

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.520
Um... Well...

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:38.090
There's no need to take a vote...

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.100
Um, Inoue.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.140
I-I know a lot happened last year,

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.100
and I caused you a lot of inconvenience.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:52.270
But, um...

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:57.360
Will you still be my friend this year?

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:04.000
I suppose.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:17.380
Look, they're making mochi!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.220
Let's dig in!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.810
This looks great.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.210
Happy New Year!

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.070
You can have some, if you'd like.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:35.590
Offerings for us? Lucky!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.650
Lady Amami, I thank you!

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.740
Aren't you gonna eat some?

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.410
I just remembered another place I wanted to visit.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.440
I think I'll bring these there.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:51.000
Let's take a picture, guys!

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:56.480
Whoa!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.000
What is it?

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:08.070
I cannot eat while Lady Amami goes without!

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.760
Eat the mochi!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:17.850
Come here... Come here...

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:24.200
Happy New Year.

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:26.900
I brought you a gift.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:31.320
Oh... Thanks.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.960
I see your gang of weirdos has grown.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:38.010
Who are you calling weird?!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.630
So this is where you wanted to visit.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:45.420
Yes.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.100
What are you doing?

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:53.130
I ate all my mochi,
and I have nothing else to offer,

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.420
so I figured I'd make him a snowman.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.900
I'll help!

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:59.190
Wow, it's cold!

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.950
Oh, fine.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:09.160
You were worried about me?

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:15.460
I really wanted to talk to you all...
I was so happy.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.380
There you are.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:22.170
I asked what color they are,
but I forgot to actually look!

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.430
Not this time!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.980
Got you!

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:31.410
How dare you persist in stalking
Lady Amami, you foul feline?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.510
Today begins a brand new year.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:36.110
I shan't cut you down, but I <i>shall</i> banish you!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.920
You're here, too, huh?

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.240
Fine, I'll take you both on!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.150
Ooh! They're gonna fight!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.530
Divine retribution!

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:50.280
Get him!

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:53.330
Hook! Uppercut!

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:56.600
Fight, fight!

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:10.010
What the heck? Gag me with a spoon!

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:42.100
I am...

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:44.350
Nay, I discarded my name long ago.

00:23:44.350 --> 00:23:44.360
Please, call me the roll-call samurai.
Nay, I discarded my name long ago.

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:46.580
Please, call me the roll-call samurai.

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:49.450
I am but a humble samurai,

00:23:49.450 --> 00:23:53.950
protecting Lady Amami in both body
and soul to repay my debt to her.

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:57.800
Ah, Lady Amami seems to have
made even more friends!

00:23:57.800 --> 00:24:01.310
It appears I have no choice but to cooperate!

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:05.400
Next time on Re-Kan!:
"Let's All Play Together."

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:09.020
Lady Amami, we shall be forever at your side.
